==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bun Bun's at a decently high magnification, so it wouldn't be a bad idea to burn an anti-Floating Uber here. If you don't anticipate that you're going to be doing much more Labyrinth, [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] should destroy this level.

